{"id": "5a6ba4d7-9e57-49c0-95f4-f29bee237730", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T12:17:45.418096", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "59d117a9-2bd0-47d5-bb99-c273558ffb56", "thought": [], "reasoning_content": "No scientific computing stack is installed at all (no numpy either). pip can't download (no network). Therefore, in this environment, nothing can actually be run. Confirming that this is a design-only task ("track.md": "Design-only task; repository and compute resources are not required.").

